<p>Before my Ph.D., I worked as a Research Assistant at Tsinghua University’s State Key Laboratory of Automotive Safety and Energy, where I led a 10-person team on autonomous driving perception. I have also co-founded and led technology teams at multiple AI startups, and founded the Qianyi AI Foundation — an international community of 20+ AI researchers exploring human-AI symbiosis.</p>
